  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://www.comico.kr/comic/1680)  \nWhat did you lose when you got married? Or what are you going to lose? The main character, Nam Lisa, has no intention of getting married, but meets a man (Choi Ho) who is good at helping as a housewife and gets married out of anger. However, contrary to what was expected, married life continues to flow in a different direction. The main character is confused about what she looked like before and after marriage. I feel like I am gradually losing myself. Is this really just the main character, Namrisa?",
